                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man lembe pa Yehova bino i bang’a, m’uwacu kumae, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wod dhanu, keth weng’i yo ba nyithindho mir Amon, man ieu lembe i kumgi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man iwac ni nyithindho mir Amon kumae, Wuwinj lembe pa Rwoth Yehova: Rwoth Yehova wacu kumae, Kum iwacu kumae, Aha, kum kamaleng’ para, kinde ma jucide; man kum ng’om mir Israel, kinde ma judwoke ni uvuru; man kum ot mi Yuda, kinde ma gicidho i ng’eca: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno, nen, abimii ni piny ni nyithindho ma yo nyangu, man gibiketho hema migi ii, man gibitimo kabedo migi ii, gibicamu nying’ piny peri, man gibimadhu cak peri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abidwoko Raba ni dwol mi ngamia, man nyithindho mir Amon ni kavuto mir udul rombe: e wubing’eyo nia an a Yehova. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum Rwoth Yehova wacu kumae: Kum iteng’o cingi, man iguro tiendi, man anyong’a negi kud adegi ceke mi ng’eyong’ec peri kum ng’om mir Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka kumeno, nen, arieyo cinga i wii, man abimii ni ayeki ni thek; man abikebi woko ku ba kodhidhanu, man abirwinyi kud i ng’om: abinyothi; e ibing’eyo nia an a Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
